# v12-merlin: written by tools/scorecard --write-fullrange. Holds at throttle 1 halfway between those of the other files
# from idle (the first hold of holds-t100.scn) to below the limiter at 3500 rpm.
# Each hold is 0.5 s of settling and at least 24 whole cycles and 1 s; 0.25 s sweeps join the holds.
hold 675 1 4.8
sweep 675 875 1 0.25
hold 875 1 3.8
sweep 875 1125 1 0.25
hold 1125 1 3.1
sweep 1125 1375 1 0.25
hold 1375 1 2.6
sweep 1375 1625 1 0.25
hold 1625 1 2.3
sweep 1625 1875 1 0.25
hold 1875 1 2.1
sweep 1875 2125 1 0.25
hold 2125 1 1.9
sweep 2125 2375 1 0.25
hold 2375 1 1.8
sweep 2375 2625 1 0.25
hold 2625 1 1.6
sweep 2625 2875 1 0.25
hold 2875 1 1.6
sweep 2875 3125 1 0.25
hold 3125 1 1.5
